<title>ITALY: Safilo '96 cons pretax profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Safilo '96 cons pretax profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>MILAN, March Reuter) - Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons pre-profit			44.2   (up 30 pct)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     53     (up 17 pct)</p>
<p>    Ord dividend			 370 lire vs unchanged</p>
<p>    Savings div			  400 lire vs unchanged</p>
<p>NOTE - Spectacle frame maker Safilo said in the first two months of 1997 its turnover had grown 46 percent. The company has already reported a consolidated turnover of 560 billion for 1996, up 35 pct on 1995. The 1997 budget forecasts a turnover above 700 billion.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
